{
    // Base Dialogue

    // Intro
    "Core.Linus.Introduction": "A stranger?#$b# OH you're the new farmer! $3#$b# My name is Linus. I live out here by myself.",

    // Spring - No Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Mon.NH": "The air here is very refreshing compared to where I use to live.#$e#Coming out here was one of the best decisions I have ever made!$1",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Tue.NH": "...#$e#Going to ridicule me like everyone else?$2",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Wen.NH": "I don't know you yet. I'd rather not talk about myself to strangers.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Thu.NH": "...Is there something you need? I don't get many visitors.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Fri.NH": "Please, just... leave my camp as you found it.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sat.NH": "I get along just fine on my own, you know.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sun.NH": "The forest is louder than the town, if you know how to listen.",
    
    // Summer - No Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Mon.NH": "The heat doesn't bother me much. I've gotten used to sleeping with the tent flaps open.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Tue.NH": "...You again. I suppose you're not going anywhere.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Wen.NH": "The nights are warm enough now that I don't mind being outdoors.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Thu.NH": "There are berries ripening near the river, if you're the type who forages.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Fri.NH": "Some people think it's strange, living like this. I've made my peace with it.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sat.NH": "The wind's been kind to me lately. Small blessings.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sun.NH": "I spent the day resting in the shade. A simple life suits me.",

    // Fall - No Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Mon.NH": "The nights are getting colder. I'll need to think about firewood soon.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Tue.NH": "...What brings you all the way out here?",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Wen.NH": "The mushrooms are good this time of year, if you know where to look.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Thu.NH": "The leaves remind me that nothing stays the same for long.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Fri.NH": "Please don't disturb my things while I'm out foraging.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sat.NH": "I'm stocking up before the cold sets in. It's peaceful work.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sun.NH": "Fall makes the whole valley smell like earth and smoke. I love it.",

    // Winter - No Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Mon.NH": "The cold is the hardest part of living like this. But I manage.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Tue.NH": "$c 0.5#...I don't get many visitors when it's this cold. Surprised to see you.#...Cold got you looking for company too?",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Wen.NH": "It's a hard season to be alone in. But I've done it before.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Thu.NH": "The frost makes everything look new, somehow. I try to focus on that.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Fri.NH": "Please, just let me be. The cold is enough to deal with as it is.$a",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sat.NH": "I make do with what I have. It's not so bad, once you accept it.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sun.NH": "The snow muffles everything. It's the quietest the valley ever gets.",

    // Spring - 2 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Mon.2H": "I think I'm starting to trust you a little, @. That's... not easy for me.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Tue.2H": "You keep coming back. I suppose that says something about you.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Wen.2H": "Spring makes even old cynics like me feel a bit lighter.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Thu.2H": "I found a patch of wild onions today. Nature always provides, if you're patient.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Fri.2H": "I don't mind you stopping by anymore. It's... nice, actually.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sat.2H": "The world wakes up slowly in spring. I like to watch it happen.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sun.2H": "I spent the morning listening to birdsong. Better than any radio.",
    
    // Summer - 2 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Mon.2H": "Summer's kind to me. Warm nights, easy foraging. And good company, lately.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Tue.2H": "You don't seem bothered by the heat, or by me. Both are rare.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Wen.2H": "I've been swimming in the river most mornings. It clears the head.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Thu.2H": "The wild berries are in season. I'll share, if you're around later.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Fri.2H": "I used to dread the weekends, when the town got crowded. Less so, now that you visit.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sat.2H": "There's a quiet kind of happiness in a warm evening and a full stomach.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sun.2H": "I caught a good haul of fish today. Guess I owe the river a thank you.$h",

    // Fall - 2 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Mon.2H": "Fall makes me think about what's worth keeping, and what's worth letting go. You're worth keeping around.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Tue.2H": "I've stopped bracing myself when I see you coming. That's new, for me.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Wen.2H": "The mushrooms are excellent this year. I'll show you the good patches, if you want.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Thu.2H": "Gathering lumber's easier with someone to talk to, even if it's just idle chatter.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Fri.2H": "I don't mind visitors as much as I used to. You've helped with that.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sat.2H": "The colors this time of year always calm me down. Maybe you'll understand why, someday.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sun.2H": "Fall's a season for reflection. Lately, I've been reflecting on how glad I am to know you.",

    // Winter - 2 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Mon.2H": "Winter's hard, but a little less so with someone checking in on me.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Tue.2H": "I didn't expect to make a friend out here. Glad I was wrong.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Wen.2H": "The cold doesn't feel so isolating when you visit.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Thu.2H": "I've started looking forward to the knock on my tent flap. That's new.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Fri.2H": "Please, stay a while if you can. The company helps more than you know.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sat.2H": "I'm managing alright this winter. Better than most, actually, thanks to you.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sun.2H": "The snow's quiet, but it's not so lonely with a friend like you around.",

    // Spring - 4 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Mon.4H": "You've earned a bit of my trust, @. That doesn't happen often.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Tue.4H": "I used to flinch when people came near my tent. I don't, with you.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Wen.4H": "Spring rain smells different out here, away from the rooftops. Cleaner, somehow.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Thu.4H": "I'll tell you a secret: I talk to the trees sometimes. They're better listeners than most people.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Fri.4H": "I've stopped worrying you'll trample my garden. Small progress, but it matters to me.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sat.4H": "Planting season keeps me busy. There's a quiet joy in watching things grow.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sun.4H": "You're becoming a friend, @. I didn't expect that, living out here.",

    // Summer - 4 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Mon.4H": "Summer makes it easy to forget my worries. Especially when you're around.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Tue.4H": "I don't scare as easily as people think. But I do warm up slowly. You've managed it.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Wen.4H": "The river's my favorite place this time of year. Come find me there sometime.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Thu.4H": "I've started setting aside the best fish for when you stop by.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Fri.4H": "I look forward to these visits more than I'll admit out loud.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sat.4H": "You know, most people wouldn't bother getting to know someone like me. I'm glad you did.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sun.4H": "Summer Sundays are for resting and thinking. Lately, I think about you being a good friend.",

    // Fall - 4 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Mon.4H": "You've stuck around longer than most people do. I appreciate that more than I show.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Tue.4H": "I don't let many people see me prepare for winter. It's personal, in a way. But I don't mind you seeing it.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Wen.4H": "Let's forage for mushrooms together sometime. I'd trust your eye for it.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Thu.4H": "I'm gathering extra lumber this year. Wouldn't mind an extra pair of hands, if you're willing.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Fri.4H": "I used to hate the sound of footsteps near my camp. Yours don't bother me anymore.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sat.4H": "There's comfort in preparing for winter with someone who cares whether you make it through.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sun.4H": "I'm grateful for you, @. More than these words probably show.",

    // Winter - 4 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Mon.4H": "I won't pretend winter's easy. But you make it more bearable, @.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Tue.4H": "I don't often admit when I'm struggling. But I trust you enough to say: this cold gets to me sometimes.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Wen.4H": "Come warm up by my fire, if you'd like. I don't mind sharing it with you.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Thu.4H": "I've set aside extra blankets, just in case you ever need them. Can't have my friend freezing.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Fri.4H": "These visits get me through the worst of the cold. More than you probably know.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sat.4H": "I used to dread winter alone. This year, it feels different, having you around.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sun.4H": "Thank you for checking on an old hermit, @. It means more than I can say.",

    // Spring - 6 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Mon.6H": "I haven't always lived like this. There was a life before... but I'd rather talk about now.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Tue.6H": "People used to cross the street to avoid me. You never have. I notice things like that.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Wen.6H": "The wildflowers are in full bloom. Walk with me sometime, if you'd like.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Thu.6H": "I've started saving the best foraging spots to show you. I don't do that for just anyone.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Fri.6H": "It's strange, having someone to look forward to seeing. I'd almost forgotten what that felt like.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sat.6H": "Spring cleaning, if you can call it that. Mostly just airing out the tent and thinking.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sun.6H": "Thank you for treating me like a person, @. Not everyone bothers.",
    
    // Summer - 6 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Mon.6H": "I trust the heat of summer. It's honest, at least. Like you've been with me.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Tue.6H": "I don't open up easily. But somehow, you've made it feel safe to.#$e#That's rare.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Wen.6H": "Let's take a walk down by the river sometime. I'd like the company.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Thu.6H": "I found the best blackberry patch in the valley. I'm saving it to show you.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Fri.6H": "I used to count down the days until people left me alone. Now I count down until you visit.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sat.6H": "You've made this a good summer, @. One of the best I can remember.#$q 4471902/4471903 linus_summerask_followup#Have you ever slept outdoors, under nothing but the stars?#$r 4471902 10 linus_summerask_yes#Yes, more than once.#$r 4471903 5 linus_summerask_no#No, never.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sun.6H": "Thank you for making an old hermit's summer a little brighter.",

    // Fall - 6 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Mon.6H": "Winter's coming, and for the first time in a long while, I'm not dreading it. That's because of you.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Tue.6H": "I trust you enough now to tell you: some winters, I've barely made it through. This year feels different.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Wen.6H": "Walk with me through the woods sometime. I'll show you where the best mushrooms hide.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Thu.6H": "I've started stockpiling enough for two, just in case you ever need it. Don't tell anyone I said that.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Fri.6H": "You've become someone I genuinely look forward to seeing. That's rare, for me.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sat.6H": "The harvest reminds me that even hard seasons can be survived, especially with the right people around.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sun.6H": "Thank you for making this fall feel less lonely than the others.",

    // Winter - 6 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Mon.6H": "I'll be honest with you: some winters nearly broke me. This one's easier, because of you.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Tue.6H": "I trust you with the hard truths now. That's not something I offer freely.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Wen.6H": "Sit by the fire with me a while. I'd rather not be alone with my thoughts tonight.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Thu.6H": "I've started keeping a spot warm for you, just in case you stop by. Don't read too much into that.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Fri.6H": "You've become one of the few people I genuinely need in my life. That scares me a little, honestly.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sat.6H": "I used to think surviving was enough. You've shown me there's more to hope for.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sun.6H": "Winter used to be my loneliest season. Not anymore, thanks to you.",

    // Spring - 8 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Mon.8H": "I used to have a home, a job, all of it. I gave it up. I don't regret it, but I don't forget it either.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Tue.8H": "You ask good questions, @. Ones that make me think instead of just defend myself.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Wen.8H": "Spring always feels like a second chance. Maybe that's why I like it best.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Thu.8H": "I trust very few people with where my best foraging spots are. You're one of them now.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Fri.8H": "I look forward to Fridays more than I used to. That's your doing.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sat.8H": "Come sit by the fire a while. I don't mind the company anymore. I might even like it.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sun.8H": "I don't say this lightly: you're one of the few good things that's happened to me out here.",
    
    // Summer - 8 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Mon.8H": "I haven't told many people this, but... the heat reminds me of where I grew up. Not all my memories from before are bad ones.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Tue.8H": "You've earned my trust in a way few ever have. I don't say that lightly.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Wen.8H": "Swim with me sometime, if you're not afraid of a little cold water and an old man's company.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Thu.8H": "I'd share my last can of food with you, @. That's not something I'd say to just anyone.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Fri.8H": "These visits mean more to me than you probably realize.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sat.8H": "I used to think happiness wasn't meant for someone like me. You've made me reconsider.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sun.8H": "Every summer feels a little less lonely with you around.",

    // Fall - 8 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Mon.8H": "$1 linusWinterSurvival#There were winters before you where I truly thought I wouldn't make it. I don't feel that way anymore.$s#$e#I still think about how far we've come since that first winter, @.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Tue.8H": "I don't say this to many people, but... I worry about you too, sometimes. That's what friendship does, I think.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Wen.8H": "There's a hidden grove I only show to people I trust completely.#$b#I'd like to show you it myself, when you're ready.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Thu.8H": "I'm setting aside supplies for you too, just in case. That's what friends do, isn't it?",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Fri.8H": "I used to think no one would ever care whether I made it through winter. You've proven me wrong.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sat.8H": "This harvest, I'm grateful for more than just food. I'm grateful for you.#$b#Here — take some of what I found today. [(O)404 (O)406 (O)408 (O)410]$h",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sun.8H": "You've changed how I see the world, @. Fall used to feel like an ending. Now it feels like a promise.",

    // Winter - 8 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Mon.8H": "There were winters before you came along where I truly thought I wouldn't make it. I don't feel that way anymore.$s",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Tue.8H": "I trust you with more than my secrets now, @. I trust you with my wellbeing.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Wen.8H": "Stay a while. I don't want to be alone tonight, and I don't say that to just anyone.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Thu.8H": "I've kept supplies aside for you all season. You matter to me more than you probably realize.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Fri.8H": "You've become family to me, in the ways that count. I hope you know that.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sat.8H": "I used to survive winter. Now, because of you, I actually look forward to the quiet moments in it.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sun.8H": "Thank you for staying by my side through the hardest season, @. It means everything.",

    // Spring - 10 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Mon.10H": "I don't know what I did to deserve a friend like you, @. But I'm grateful for it, every day.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Tue.10H": "I used to think I'd live and die alone out here. You've made me reconsider that.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Wen.10H": "Every spring I think about starting over. This year, I think I finally have, thanks to you.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Thu.10H": "There's a spot deep in the woods I've never shown anyone. Someday, I'll take you there.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Fri.10H": "You've given an old hermit something he thought he'd lost for good: real friendship.",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sat.10H": "I used to fear the world had nothing left for me. Then you showed up.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Spring.Sun.10H": "Thank you, @. For everything. For seeing me as more than the man in the tent.",
    
    // Summer - 10 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Mon.10H": "You've become one of the most important people in my life, @. I mean that.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Tue.10H": "I don't fear the future the way I used to. Having a friend like you helps.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Wen.10H": "Come swim with me. Not because you have to. Because I'd like to share the moment with you.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Thu.10H": "I'd give you the very last of what I have, without a second thought. That's what friendship means to me.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Fri.10H": "I used to live for the quiet. Now I live for the moments we spend together too.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sat.10H": "This summer, more than any other, I've felt like I belong somewhere. Thank you for that.",
    "Core.Linus.Summer.Sun.10H": "I don't know how to properly thank you for everything, @. So I'll just say: thank you, my friend.$h",

    // Fall - 10 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Mon.10H": "I don't fear winter the way I used to, not with a friend like you in my life.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Tue.10H": "I trust you completely, @. That's not something I say lightly, or to just anyone.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Wen.10H": "That hidden grove I told you about - let's go there together. I want to share it with you.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Thu.10H": "Whatever winter brings, I know we'll face it together. That means more to me than you know.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Fri.10H": "You've given me something I thought I'd lost forever: someone who genuinely cares.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sat.10H": "This harvest season, I'm thankful most of all for you, @.",
    "Core.Linus.Fall.Sun.10H": "I don't know how to say this without sounding sentimental, but... you've changed my life, my friend.$h",

    // Winter - 10 Hearts
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Mon.10H": "I don't know how I survived the winters before you, @. I'm just glad I don't have to anymore.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Tue.10H": "You are the truest friend I've ever had. I trust you completely, without reservation.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Wen.10H": "Sit with me by the fire, my friend. There's nowhere else I'd rather be.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Thu.10H": "Everything I have, I'd share with you without hesitation. That's what you mean to me.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Fri.10H": "You've given a lonely old hermit something he never thought he'd have again: a true friend.$h",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sat.10H": "I used to just endure winter. Now, with you, even the coldest days feel warm.",
    "Core.Linus.Winter.Sun.10H": "Thank you, @, for everything. You've changed my life more than words can say.$l",

    // Special dialogue command examples (question/response chain used by Summer.Sat.6H)
    "Core.Linus.SummerAsk.Yes": "Then you understand something most people never will.$h",
    "Core.Linus.SummerAsk.No": "You should try it sometime. It changes you.$u",
    "Core.Linus.SummerAsk.Followup": "$p 4471902#I still think about that conversation sometimes.|You should really give it a try sometime.$u"
}